{"kind":"artifact","text":"internal/docset at 5caf6e85: the documentation gate follows a retirement to its successor. ClassifyCitation takes whether the retirement named one, and reports a citation of a retired-with-successor artifact as a flare rather than failing the set; a retirement that names nothing is still fatal. SucceededRetirements reads that fact from the projection: an effective supersession resting on an artifact at the same path or a directory covering it. Without this, retirement alone being fatal meant a documented-area merge was either refused or took main red.","body":{"commit":"5caf6e853d838e0a18a47a37a68f7deba6abc3c0","path":"internal/docset"}}